# Runtime upload storage (STORAGE_DIR), at the package root only.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash on purpose. The previous bare `uploads`
# pattern matched a directory of that name at ANY depth, so it also
# swallowed src/uploads/ — the uploads module itself. That is why
# app.module.ts imported './uploads/uploads.module' while no such file
# existed in the repository: `git add` silently skipped it, and every
# fresh clone failed to compile with TS2307.
/uploads/
dump.rdb
